  "fields": {
    "title": "Chicken Stir-Fry",
    "description": "Quick chicken and vegetable stir-fry cooked in one pan with a light soy sauce.",
    "instructions": "Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat.\r\n\r\nAdd chicken and cook until browned.\r\n\r\nAdd vegetables and garlic and stir-fry 3�5 minutes.\r\n\r\nAdd soy sauce and mix well.\r\n\r\nCook until vegetables are tender and serve.",
