  "fields": {
    "title": "Pancakes",
    "description": "Fluffy homemade pancakes perfect for weekend breakfast",
    "instructions": "1. Mix flour, eggs, milk, and sugar in a bowl.\\n2. Heat a pan with butter over medium heat.\\n3. Pour batter and cook until bubbles form.\\n4. Flip and cook other side until golden.\\n5. Serve with maple syrup and butter.",
